      },
      "kind": "intro",
      "text": "Quincy Jones asked for a rock song like My Sharona, so Michael Jackson wrote Beat It. It shuttles from minor to flat seven.",
      "image": "artist-Q2831",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "Beat It (Wikipedia)",
          "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beat_It"
        },
        {
          "title": "Michael Jackson, Beat It (Hooktheory TheoryTab, chords)",
